{% doc %}
  The full screen image viewer of the product page: one native <dialog>, opened by the zoom buttons that
  sections/main-product.liquid puts over each gallery image. assets/zoom.js fills it. Decision record:
  docs/decisions/014-product-image-zoom-is-a-native-dialog.md.

  The viewer is a column of screens, one image per screen with no padding: the whole image, a line of caption
  under it (the description without any "AI generated" wording and, when the image belongs to variants, "Shown for:
  Moss / M"), the image count "1 / 2" in the top start corner when there are several images, and nothing pushed
  out of the viewport, however long the caption. Scrolling snaps from image to image (wheel, finger or scroll bar; pinch zoom works natively);
  the arrow keys and Space jump too. The image the shopper pressed is in view when it opens, and Escape or the
  close button return to the gallery with focus on the button that opened it.

  The images are built by the script the first time the viewer opens, so a page nobody zooms carries only this
  shell. The image width and height attributes of the one <img> in the markup are only there for the markup rules.

  Focus starts on the scrolling area (autofocus), not on a button: Space on a focused Close button would close
  the viewer instead of moving to the next image. The dialog is modal, so the page behind it is inert.

  Rendered once per page, only when the setting "Let shoppers zoom product images" is on.

  @example
  {% render 'product-zoom' %}
{% enddoc %}

<dialog class="zoom" aria-label="{{ product.title | escape }}">
  <div class="zoom__stage" tabindex="0" autofocus></div>
  <button class="icon-button zoom__close" type="button" data-zoom-close aria-label="{{ 'general.close' | t }}">
    {%- render 'icon', name: 'close' -%}
  </button>
  <p class="visually-hidden" role="status" data-zoom-live></p>
</dialog>

<script src="{{ 'zoom.js' | asset_url }}" type="module"></script>

{% stylesheet %}
  html:has(dialog.zoom[open]) { overflow: hidden; }
  .zoom { width: 100%; height: 100dvh; max-width: none; max-height: none; margin: 0; padding: 0; border: 0; background: var(--color-bg); color: var(--color-fg); }
  .zoom[open] { display: block; }
  .zoom__stage { height: 100%; overflow-y: auto; overscroll-behavior: contain; scroll-snap-type: y mandatory; touch-action: pan-y pinch-zoom; }
  .zoom__stage:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--color-accent); outline-offset: -4px; }
  .zoom__item { display: grid; grid-template-rows: minmax(0, 1fr) auto; height: 100%; margin: 0; scroll-snap-align: start; scroll-snap-stop: always; }
  .zoom__frame { position: relative; min-height: 0; isolation: isolate; }
  .zoom__frame img { display: block; width: 100%; height: 100%; border-radius: 0; object-fit: contain; }
  .zoom__frame img:first-child { opacity: 0; transition: opacity 0.2s; }
  .zoom__frame img:first-child[data-loaded] { opacity: 1; }
  .zoom__frame img:nth-child(2) { position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: -1; }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { .zoom__frame img:first-child { transition: none; } }
  .zoom__item figcaption { display: grid; gap: 0.125rem; max-height: 7rem; padding: 0.5rem 4rem; overflow-y: auto; text-align: center; font-size: 0.8125rem; line-height: 1.35; color: var(--color-muted); }
  .zoom__count { position: absolute; inset-block-start: 0.75rem; inset-inline-start: 0.75rem; padding: 0.25rem 0.5rem; border-radius: var(--radius); background: var(--color-bg); color: var(--color-fg); font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; letter-spacing: var(--tracking-wide); opacity: 0.85; }
  .zoom__item figcaption span:last-child { color: var(--color-fg); }
  .zoom__close { position: absolute; z-index: 1; inset-block-start: 0.75rem; inset-inline-end: 0.75rem; background: var(--color-bg); border: 1px solid var(--color-control); }
{% endstylesheet %}
